    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      404.72,
      286.44,
      476.47
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give Notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose:- Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      477.2,
      286.44,
      597.2
    ],
    "text": "The allotment of land called \u201c Pitawela Arawa alias Nethervil; Estate\u201d in total extent of about 0.0998 Hectare, depicted as Lot No. 291 in Final Villge Plan No. 2A, Suppliment No. 13, Sheet No. 15, dated on 30.01.2017, surveyed and prepared by the Surveyor General situated at the village of Gotuwela in Madhuragama Grama Niladhari Division, No. 68C, in Kumbalwela Korale Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Ella in Badulla District, Uva Province and bounded as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      598.64,
      286.43,
      643.28
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 291 Name of the Land: Pitawela Arawa alias Nethervil Estate; Extent: 0.0998 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      331.28,
      539.38,
      364.4
    ],
    "text": "Boundaries: North by: Lot No. 38; East by: Lot No; 38 and 40; South by: Lot No. 40 and 38; West by: Lot No. 38",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      365.84,
      591.94,
      410.24
    ],
    "text": "Name and Address of the claimants: 1. Hapugastenna Plantation Company (P.L.C.), No. 95A, Nambapana, Ingiriya.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      411.68,
      541.79,
      525.44
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office at, Ella on the 27th July 2017 and at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing duplicate to on or before 20th July 2017 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      537.45,
      539.4,
      627.68
    ],
    "text": "K. D. THANUKSHA N. ABEYWARDANA, Divisional Secretary, Ella. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office, Ella, 25th April, 2017.",
